# Stow + Ansible

- Configs live under `stow/<pkg>/` mirroring `$HOME`. Apply with `./stow.sh restow <pkg>`.
- Pins and `stow_packages` live in `ansible/group_vars/all.yml`. Bump then `./setup.sh --tags …`.
- Do not hand-create parallel copies under `~` outside Stow.
- Deeper map: `docs/architecture.md`, `docs/setup-stow.md`.
